   ],
   "so": {
    "figures": {},
    "literals": [],
    "text": "A larger cap has not raised what comes off tax bills in total: the total follows the number of people taking part."
   },
   "text": "The cap doubled, from $750 to $1,500; a season’s total fell from $10,500.00 to $4,406.25."
