   "so": {
    "figures": {},
    "literals": [],
    "text": "Together they earned about half of it. Whether for lack of hours or by choice, no record held says."
   },
   "text": "In 2025, 6 seniors earned $4,406.25 of the $9,000.00 their caps allowed."
